WEBVTT

00:00:00.890 --> 00:00:04.270
<i>Gunpla Battle combat mode, startup.</i>

00:00:04.270 --> 00:00:07.150
<i>Model damage level, set to A.</i>

00:00:07.650 --> 00:00:10.240
<i>Please set your GP Base.</i>

00:00:12.740 --> 00:00:15.160
<i>Beginning Plavsky particle dispersal.</i>

00:00:17.580 --> 00:00:20.250
<i>Field 1, Space.</i>

00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:24.500
<i>Please set your Gunpla.</i>

00:00:29.090 --> 00:00:30.340
<i>Battle start.</i>

00:01:09.790 --> 00:01:12.010
The first wave are doing their best, but...

00:01:53.960 --> 00:01:55.300
<i>I love Gundam.</i>

00:02:03.260 --> 00:02:04.720
<i>I love Gunpla.</i>

00:02:11.440 --> 00:02:15.490
<i>But the person who I promised to fight with...</i>

00:02:16.780 --> 00:02:19.700
<i>took a different path from mine.</i>

00:02:30.170 --> 00:02:31.790
<i>I don't want to give up!</i>

00:02:49.560 --> 00:02:50.520
<i>Somebody...</i>

00:02:52.060 --> 00:02:53.940
<i>please fight with me!</i>

00:02:58.860 --> 00:02:59.990
<i>I want to play...</i>

00:03:05.450 --> 00:03:08.580
<i>I want to play Gunpla Battle!</i>

00:03:27.140 --> 00:03:29.180
S-So strong...

00:03:29.980 --> 00:03:30.980
Hey, you.

00:03:32.350 --> 00:03:35.310
Have you seen the girl in this photo?

00:03:44.820 --> 00:03:47.790
Have you seen the girl in this photo?

00:03:48.910 --> 00:03:50.250
I want to know where she is.

00:03:50.710 --> 00:03:53.710
Sh-She's a hottie.

00:03:53.710 --> 00:03:55.380
Is she your girlfriend?

00:03:55.380 --> 00:03:57.670
That's not what I asked.

00:03:57.670 --> 00:03:59.710
I said, do you know where she is?

00:03:59.710 --> 00:04:01.920
I might've seen her...

00:04:01.920 --> 00:04:02.550
Where?!

00:04:02.550 --> 00:04:03.470
I don't know!

00:04:03.470 --> 00:04:04.470
You said you saw her!

00:04:04.470 --> 00:04:06.220
Sorry. Please don't get mad!

00:04:06.220 --> 00:04:07.850
Hey! What's going on over there?

00:04:09.270 --> 00:04:11.230
No, this guy just...

00:04:11.560 --> 00:04:13.270
Help me, Officer! This guy's gonna kill me!

00:04:13.270 --> 00:04:14.190
Help!

00:04:14.190 --> 00:04:15.400
Wh-What are you saying?

00:04:15.940 --> 00:04:16.730
What?

00:04:22.030 --> 00:04:24.360
Care to explain your story? {Let's hear your story... or something police-like?} {original: Would you explain what's going on?}

00:04:24.990 --> 00:04:26.280
Seriously?

00:04:28.030 --> 00:04:32.210
Today, I have exciting news for you all.

00:04:32.210 --> 00:04:36.380
At the Artistic Gunpla Contest which was held yesterday, {oh look, it's Principal/General Revil}

00:04:36.380 --> 00:04:41.050
a model made by Yuuma Kousaka, a second year student from our very own Seihou Academy,

00:04:41.050 --> 00:04:43.720
received the glorious Grand Prix.

00:04:45.380 --> 00:04:47.890
Kousaka, please come to the stage.

00:04:47.890 --> 00:04:49.060
Yuuma!

00:04:49.060 --> 00:04:50.770
Kousaka!

00:04:51.520 --> 00:04:53.270
Yuuma!

00:04:55.810 --> 00:04:56.770
<i>Yuu...</i>

00:04:58.810 --> 00:05:01.070
<i>You're not joining the Gunpla Battle Club?</i>

00:05:01.780 --> 00:05:02.990
Why not?

00:05:04.650 --> 00:05:06.610
I've lost interest.

00:05:08.570 --> 00:05:10.580
<i>I'm not into Gunpla Battle anymore.</i>

00:05:17.460 --> 00:05:19.250
Miyaga.

00:05:19.840 --> 00:05:22.340
Kousaka is really amazing.

00:05:22.340 --> 00:05:24.590
As the president of the Plastic Model Club,

00:05:24.590 --> 00:05:27.510
I'm proud to have such an 
outstanding club member.

00:05:27.510 --> 00:05:28.930
I suppose so.

00:05:30.100 --> 00:05:34.520
Hoshino, how long will you persist in sticking with the Gunpla Battle Club?

00:05:35.270 --> 00:05:42.150
The club is still allowed to exist because a student 
from our school won the World Tournament once.

00:05:42.150 --> 00:05:44.570
But that was seven years ago.

00:05:44.570 --> 00:05:46.990
It's a past glory.

00:05:46.990 --> 00:05:48.490
As proof of that,

00:05:48.490 --> 00:05:52.790
the club's dwindled down over the years 
until finally, you're the only member left.

00:05:52.790 --> 00:05:55.660
Because the Plastic Model 
Club stole all our members!

00:05:55.660 --> 00:05:57.620
You shouldn't say such things.

00:05:57.620 --> 00:06:00.920
We attract more people because we win contests,

00:06:00.920 --> 00:06:06.760
while your Gunpla Battle Club
 loses in the first round every year.

00:06:06.760 --> 00:06:10.550
Gunpla Battle makes no sense in the first place.

00:06:10.550 --> 00:06:13.260
You have to fight with a model
 you've poured everything into building

00:06:13.260 --> 00:06:15.810
and it gets ruined if you lose.

00:06:15.810 --> 00:06:18.560
The whole concept is a contradiction.

00:06:19.150 --> 00:06:22.570
Originally, the right and proper way of plastic modeling

00:06:22.570 --> 00:06:28.200
was to enjoy the building process 
itself and seek perfection of your work.

00:06:28.700 --> 00:06:30.030
Hoshino,

00:06:30.030 --> 00:06:34.240
I have great respect for your ability as a Gunpla builder.

00:06:34.580 --> 00:06:37.910
You're welcome to join our club anytime.

00:06:37.910 --> 00:06:39.620
No thank you.

00:06:39.620 --> 00:06:42.210
I want to play Gunpla Battle!

00:06:44.920 --> 00:06:46.840
Fumina Hoshino...

00:06:46.840 --> 00:06:48.800
You're being unreasonable.

00:06:48.800 --> 00:06:53.140
But that stubbornness is also one of your charms.

00:06:54.560 --> 00:06:57.980
What's with that praying mantis man? 
Everything he says ticks me off!

00:06:58.890 --> 00:07:01.150
I'm so angry! Argh!

00:06:59.390 --> 00:07:02.860
<i>Mirai Kamiki of senior high school, Class 2-A,</i>

00:07:02.860 --> 00:07:05.400
<i>please come to the faculty office.</i>

00:07:05.400 --> 00:07:09.990
<i>Once again, Mirai Kamiki of senior high school, Class 2-A,</i>

00:07:05.400 --> 00:07:07.070
Mirai, they're calling you.

00:07:08.860 --> 00:07:09.990
Right.

00:07:10.910 --> 00:07:12.410
I'm telling you!

00:07:12.410 --> 00:07:15.620
They suddenly ganged up on me!

00:07:15.620 --> 00:07:17.370
They said I was disrespectful!

00:07:17.370 --> 00:07:18.910
And so it became a fight?

00:07:18.910 --> 00:07:20.080
It wasn't a fight!

00:07:20.460 --> 00:07:21.830
You know, it was...

00:07:21.830 --> 00:07:24.170
It was legitimate self-defense!

00:07:24.170 --> 00:07:26.500
You took them all down by yourself?

00:07:28.920 --> 00:07:30.930
I know a bit of martial arts.

00:07:31.380 --> 00:07:32.430
Karate?

00:07:32.430 --> 00:07:35.300
Ever heard of the Jigen Haoh style?

00:07:35.300 --> 00:07:36.220
No.

00:07:36.220 --> 00:07:38.350
It's pretty obscure.

00:07:38.350 --> 00:07:41.600
Anyway, I contacted your guardian.

00:07:41.600 --> 00:07:43.310
What? Did you tell her everything?

00:07:43.310 --> 00:07:45.310
Of course I did.

00:07:45.310 --> 00:07:50.440
I'll have you know it was very hard to 
find her, with only a name to work with.

00:07:50.440 --> 00:07:52.820
Excuse me.

00:07:54.820 --> 00:07:58.700
I'm Mirai Kamiki, Sekai Kamiki's guardian.

00:07:59.620 --> 00:08:04.880
I'm sorry he caused so much trouble.

00:08:05.960 --> 00:08:08.550
I-It's fine... {Y-Yes...}

00:08:13.720 --> 00:08:16.800
You want to enter the 
Gunpla Battle Championship?

00:08:16.800 --> 00:08:21.350
But Hoshino, you need a team of three people.

00:08:21.350 --> 00:08:22.980
You're the only member, so...

00:08:22.980 --> 00:08:26.150
I'll gather more members before the entry deadline!

00:08:26.980 --> 00:08:28.690
Hello!

00:08:28.690 --> 00:08:31.320
I'm Sekai Kamiki, the new transfer student.

00:08:31.320 --> 00:08:32.900
Transfer student?

00:08:32.900 --> 00:08:35.700
We weren't told about that at the staff meeting.

00:08:35.700 --> 00:08:38.740
I was supposed to be here more than a month ago.

00:08:38.740 --> 00:08:41.410
A month? Why are you so late?!

00:08:41.410 --> 00:08:45.210
Well, I was on a training trip with my master.

00:08:45.210 --> 00:08:48.460
Anyway, which class am I joining?

00:08:49.340 --> 00:08:50.800
Wait just a minute.

00:08:50.800 --> 00:08:52.720
I'll ask your grade's head teacher.

00:08:53.510 --> 00:08:54.630
What's your name again?

00:08:54.630 --> 00:08:56.510
Sekai Kamiki.

00:08:56.510 --> 00:08:57.470
And your grade?

00:08:57.470 --> 00:08:58.300
Second year.

00:08:58.300 --> 00:09:01.140
Sekai Kamiki, second year...

00:09:01.140 --> 00:09:02.480
Wait here.

00:09:02.480 --> 00:09:05.440
Okay, thank you.

00:09:10.070 --> 00:09:11.900
You're a student here, right?

00:09:13.440 --> 00:09:17.410
I'm Fumina Hoshino, third year. 
Nice to meet you, Mr. Transfer Student.

00:09:18.870 --> 00:09:20.120
Nice to meet ya!

00:09:21.290 --> 00:09:24.910
So, is there a karate club here?

00:09:24.910 --> 00:09:27.080
Karate club? No.

00:09:27.080 --> 00:09:29.590
How about a judo or kendo club?

00:09:29.590 --> 00:09:33.920
Nope. There aren't any 
martial arts clubs at our school.

00:09:33.920 --> 00:09:37.680
What?! Then what club am I gonna join?

00:09:40.220 --> 00:09:42.220
Hey, do you like Gunpla?

00:09:43.100 --> 00:09:45.680
Gunpla? What's that?

00:09:46.310 --> 00:09:50.690
Gundam plastic models. "Gunpla" for short.

00:09:52.610 --> 00:09:53.820
Never heard of it?

00:09:54.400 --> 00:09:55.320
No.

00:09:55.320 --> 00:09:56.740
Unbelievable!

00:09:56.740 --> 00:10:00.200
To think in this day and age there's a boy who's never heard of Gunpla!

00:10:00.570 --> 00:10:04.540
It's not like he transferred here from another planet.

00:10:04.540 --> 00:10:08.370
So this Gun-whatever... It's that famous?

00:10:09.920 --> 00:10:12.170
Of course!

00:10:12.170 --> 00:10:15.800
Why don't you try playing Gunpla Battle?

00:10:15.800 --> 00:10:17.970
It's a <i>real</i> battle... No...

00:10:17.970 --> 00:10:20.050
It's the <i>ultimate</i> battle!

00:10:20.050 --> 00:10:21.680
Ultimate battle?!

00:10:21.680 --> 00:10:24.140
So you <i>do</i> have martial arts clubs!

00:10:24.140 --> 00:10:25.980
Why didn't you tell me?

00:10:27.230 --> 00:10:28.440
Sorry.

00:10:28.440 --> 00:10:30.480
Off to the club room, then.

00:10:30.480 --> 00:10:32.020
But I...

00:10:32.020 --> 00:10:33.730
Let's go, let's go!

00:10:33.730 --> 00:10:35.280
H-Hey...

00:10:37.650 --> 00:10:41.240
Sekai Kamiki, Class 2-B.

00:10:42.580 --> 00:10:45.040
Huh? Where'd he go?

00:10:53.000 --> 00:10:55.590
Where's the dojo?

00:10:55.590 --> 00:10:56.590
Here we are.

00:10:59.840 --> 00:11:02.970
This is a plastic model used for Gunpla Battle.

00:11:03.930 --> 00:11:05.060
A Gunpla!

00:11:12.400 --> 00:11:13.520
I'm leaving!

00:11:13.520 --> 00:11:15.400
N-No, wait!

00:11:15.400 --> 00:11:17.320
That's just a toy!

00:11:17.320 --> 00:11:19.950
It's a <i>plastic model</i>. A Gunpla!

00:11:19.950 --> 00:11:23.910
Let go of that door! Come on!

00:11:24.910 --> 00:11:28.450
<i>Gunpla Battle simulation mode, startup.</i>

00:11:29.040 --> 00:11:31.870
<i>Model damage level, set to C.</i>

00:11:31.870 --> 00:11:36.300
Gunpla Battle is played within this battle system.

00:11:39.130 --> 00:11:41.590
How can you be smiling while explaining this?!

00:11:41.590 --> 00:11:43.590
Forget it, just untie me already!

00:11:43.590 --> 00:11:45.260
<i>Please set your GP Base.</i>

00:11:45.260 --> 00:11:49.310
First, you insert the GP Base 
containing the Gunpla and fighter data.

00:11:49.310 --> 00:11:50.180
Are you even listening?!

00:11:51.060 --> 00:11:54.150
<i>Beginning Plavsky particle dispersal.</i>

00:11:59.400 --> 00:12:01.320
Isn't it beautiful?

00:12:01.320 --> 00:12:04.910
You'll be amazed to see what these shiny particles can do.

00:12:06.080 --> 00:12:08.490
<i>Field 2, Desert. {mm dessert}</i>

00:12:09.330 --> 00:12:11.210
They become like this!

00:12:11.210 --> 00:12:13.500
It looks so real.

00:12:13.500 --> 00:12:14.630
And...

00:12:15.210 --> 00:12:17.800
When you set your Gunpla on the GP Base,

00:12:18.590 --> 00:12:20.090
you're ready to battle.

00:12:27.220 --> 00:12:28.430
<i>Battle start.</i>

00:12:28.430 --> 00:12:32.140
Fumina Hoshino, Powered GM Cardigan, here I go! {cardigan? wtf} {early scans made people translate it to Guardian, but apparently that was an error hue}

00:12:39.980 --> 00:12:41.400
Oh, it flew!

00:12:41.400 --> 00:12:44.570
Using this console, you can control the Gunpla.

00:12:48.990 --> 00:12:52.200
Wow! It's as if it's alive.

00:12:52.960 --> 00:12:54.500
Is something coming?

00:12:56.460 --> 00:12:58.880
It's the simulation mode's enemy machine.

00:12:58.880 --> 00:12:59.710
<i>Huh?</i>

00:13:00.630 --> 00:13:01.840
Just watch.

00:13:03.550 --> 00:13:04.590
It fired a beam?!

00:13:07.510 --> 00:13:09.350
There's also this kind of weapon.

00:13:24.610 --> 00:13:27.030
What do you think? This is Gunpla Battle!

00:13:27.910 --> 00:13:29.410
Gunpla Battle...  {mfw when Turn A poster in the background} {lol ikr}

00:13:29.410 --> 00:13:31.290
Don't you wanna try?

00:13:31.290 --> 00:13:33.330
I'll show you how.

00:13:34.250 --> 00:13:35.290
Yeah, yeah!

00:13:40.920 --> 00:13:43.010
Choose whichever one you like.

00:13:53.310 --> 00:13:56.690
The 7th World Tournament Champion,

00:13:56.690 --> 00:13:58.810
Team Sei Iori and Reiji.

00:14:04.610 --> 00:14:06.990
<i>Th-This is...</i>

00:14:06.990 --> 00:14:08.780
Have you chosen your Gunpla?

00:14:10.370 --> 00:14:12.030
I'll pick this one! {I CHOOSE YOU!}

00:14:12.370 --> 00:14:15.620
It's a Dom—the Zeon forces' heavy mobile suit. {just Dom, or A/The Dom?}

00:14:15.620 --> 00:14:17.540
Great choice. {tasteful}

00:14:18.710 --> 00:14:21.710
I never knew we had one of those.

00:14:23.590 --> 00:14:25.880
Now, try to move it like I told you.

00:14:25.880 --> 00:14:28.300
Okay, here goes!

00:14:36.520 --> 00:14:38.440
<i>Yeah, not bad!</i>

00:14:39.020 --> 00:14:42.860
<i>Change the move slot to number 2.</i>

00:14:43.820 --> 00:14:44.690
This one?

00:14:52.070 --> 00:14:53.910
It's sliding on the ground!

00:14:53.910 --> 00:14:55.540
<i>This is hover mode.</i>

00:14:56.200 --> 00:14:59.210
Wow! This is fun!

00:15:02.210 --> 00:15:03.790
Wait! If you go too far—

00:15:04.000 --> 00:15:05.250
Huh?

00:15:06.460 --> 00:15:07.920
You'll go out of bounds!

00:15:17.640 --> 00:15:19.600
Ouch... {does this have to happen in every anime} {this is satire from Sunrise's part, roll with it}

00:15:19.600 --> 00:15:20.480
The Gunpla?

00:15:22.900 --> 00:15:24.610
What a relief.

00:15:29.320 --> 00:15:32.740
I-If you go out of bounds, the Gunpla stops moving.

00:15:32.740 --> 00:15:33.740
So be careful.

00:15:33.740 --> 00:15:35.240
O-Okay.

00:15:36.030 --> 00:15:37.160
What are you...

00:15:37.160 --> 00:15:38.080
Huh?

00:15:39.710 --> 00:15:42.920
What're you guys doing?!

00:15:47.300 --> 00:15:50.720
I see... So that was just an accident.

00:15:50.720 --> 00:15:52.220
I'm relieved.

00:15:52.220 --> 00:15:55.140
Anyway, are you a new member?

00:15:55.140 --> 00:15:59.390
It looks like you have no experience in either battle or model-building.

00:15:59.890 --> 00:16:02.980
Hoshino, are you seriously thinking

00:16:02.980 --> 00:16:06.060
of entering the Gunpla Battle 
Championship with this amateur?

00:16:06.060 --> 00:16:07.150
Is that a problem?

00:16:07.150 --> 00:16:08.860
You'll only embarrass yourself.

00:16:09.650 --> 00:16:12.490
You came out of nowhere. Who the heck are you?

00:16:13.110 --> 00:16:16.200
I'm Daiki Miyaga, the president of the Plastic Model Club.

00:16:16.200 --> 00:16:20.450
You'd better watch your 
attitude towards upperclassmen.

00:16:20.950 --> 00:16:23.830
If people are rude to you, be rude back.

00:16:23.830 --> 00:16:25.130
That's my master's teaching.

00:16:26.340 --> 00:16:28.460
If you're such a big talker,

00:16:28.460 --> 00:16:32.220
I suppose you're strong in Gunpla Battle.

00:16:32.220 --> 00:16:33.470
Wanna try me?

00:16:33.470 --> 00:16:37.050
Sure. I know a bit about battle, too.

00:16:37.050 --> 00:16:38.310
Wait!

00:16:38.310 --> 00:16:40.720
He just started battling today!

00:16:40.720 --> 00:16:43.480
There are only two months 
until the regional qualifiers.

00:16:43.480 --> 00:16:46.900
You don't have time to take it easy.

00:16:47.360 --> 00:16:50.070
Then I'll play, too.

00:16:50.480 --> 00:16:53.240
I'll support you. That's okay, right?

00:16:53.240 --> 00:16:56.160
Yes, go ahead.

00:16:56.700 --> 00:16:57.530
Hey!

00:16:57.530 --> 00:17:01.870
President Miyaga is fighting the members of the Battle Club!

00:17:11.000 --> 00:17:13.420
A Gunpla Battle, huh... {oh fuck its Ral}

00:17:14.840 --> 00:17:15.970
An Enact? {spelling checked}

00:17:17.840 --> 00:17:21.560
It's built well. I would expect 
no less from the club president.

00:17:21.560 --> 00:17:23.350
<i>This is nothing.</i>

00:17:23.770 --> 00:17:27.730
Any member of my club 
could build a model like this

00:17:27.730 --> 00:17:29.110
<i>in just 2 days!</i>

00:17:31.610 --> 00:17:33.240
It's faster than it looks!

00:17:33.900 --> 00:17:34.700
<i>Hoshino!</i>

00:17:35.450 --> 00:17:37.110
No! If you go forward—

00:17:38.030 --> 00:17:39.410
<i>Amateur!</i>

00:17:49.880 --> 00:17:50.840
Sekai!

00:17:54.340 --> 00:17:59.140
Since you're so obsessed with 
Gunpla Battle, I'll let you in on the truth.

00:17:59.850 --> 00:18:02.220
The student council executives

00:18:02.220 --> 00:18:05.020
are considering shutting 
down the Gunpla Battle Club.

00:18:05.020 --> 00:18:06.180
Shutting it down?!

00:18:15.150 --> 00:18:16.900
You'll be shut down on the grounds

00:18:16.900 --> 00:18:20.530
that you're inferior to the
 Plastic Model Club at battling.

00:18:21.330 --> 00:18:24.790
So <i>that's</i> why you challenged us.

00:18:24.790 --> 00:18:25.500
You jerk!

00:18:25.870 --> 00:18:28.580
I asked you so many times to join my club.

00:18:28.580 --> 00:18:31.040
But you kept turning me down!

00:18:31.040 --> 00:18:33.750
<i>You refused my offer!</i>

00:18:33.750 --> 00:18:35.050
How can you be so selfish?!

00:18:46.770 --> 00:18:48.640
<i>Y-You!</i>

00:18:49.270 --> 00:18:51.060
<i>Your opponent...</i>

00:18:51.060 --> 00:18:52.980
is me!

00:18:57.780 --> 00:18:59.030
<i>Sekai!</i>

00:18:59.030 --> 00:19:00.860
Don't worry, Hoshino.

00:19:06.870 --> 00:19:07.870
I have...

00:19:09.330 --> 00:19:10.790
<i>this!</i>

00:19:15.630 --> 00:19:17.960
What can you do without weapons?

00:19:21.550 --> 00:19:23.640
<i>I'll skewer you!</i>

00:19:38.280 --> 00:19:39.820
W-With his bare hands?!

00:19:54.540 --> 00:19:59.130
<i>Seiken-Zuki: Heavenly Fist</i>

00:19:54.540 --> 00:19:59.130
<i>Jigen Haoh style! Seiken-Zuki! {Heavenly Fist}{holy fist thrust}</i>

00:20:19.820 --> 00:20:21.450
My artwork...

00:20:22.360 --> 00:20:26.870
Sekai... I can't believe this 
was his first Gunpla Battle.

00:20:26.870 --> 00:20:29.240
He reminds me of seven years ago.

00:20:29.240 --> 00:20:33.080
It's like the second coming of Reiji.

00:20:34.210 --> 00:20:36.210
How was my fist?

00:20:36.210 --> 00:20:36.880
This is...

00:20:38.170 --> 00:20:40.800
<i>the Jigen Haoh style{of martial arts}!</i>

00:20:46.090 --> 00:20:47.100
What?!

00:20:47.100 --> 00:20:47.970
An attack?

00:20:47.970 --> 00:20:48.680
Who?

00:20:57.940 --> 00:20:59.860
That's China's...

00:21:01.190 --> 00:21:02.280
Yuu?

00:21:02.280 --> 00:21:04.910
Kousaka, you came.

00:21:04.910 --> 00:21:08.950
Now, show them the difference in skill between our two clubs!

00:21:10.870 --> 00:21:12.660
A surprise attack...

00:21:12.660 --> 00:21:14.210
How dare you!

00:21:19.790 --> 00:21:22.880
But I'm dodging them! Can he read my moves?

00:21:27.220 --> 00:21:29.680
Stop! This battle is already—

00:21:29.680 --> 00:21:30.640
<i>Not yet!</i>

00:21:31.720 --> 00:21:33.730
I can hear it.

00:21:33.730 --> 00:21:35.940
This Gunpla is yelling—

00:21:35.940 --> 00:21:39.610
"I haven't lost yet... Not yet!"

00:22:17.940 --> 00:22:19.350
What?!

00:22:19.350 --> 00:22:21.770
Another Gunpla emerged from within?

00:22:22.230 --> 00:22:23.190
That's...

00:22:23.190 --> 00:22:25.360
That machine is...

00:22:34.740 --> 00:22:36.870
the Build Burning Gundam!

00:22:43.960 --> 00:22:48.050
This movement! This mobility! It's just like...

00:22:48.050 --> 00:22:53.140
<i>Shippuu-Zuki: Hurricane Fist</i>

00:22:48.050 --> 00:22:53.140
Jigen Haoh style! Shippuu-Zuki! {wind thrust} {Hurricane Fist}

00:23:02.060 --> 00:23:03.320
What's going on?

00:23:03.940 --> 00:23:06.480
That wind is coming out of the system!

00:23:07.190 --> 00:23:10.660
He is... Sekai is...

00:23:10.660 --> 00:23:13.830
He's calling the wind.

00:23:13.830 --> 00:23:15.740
<i>One more!</i>

00:23:26.840 --> 00:23:28.630
<i>Battle aborted.</i>

00:23:31.890 --> 00:23:33.470
S-Sis?! {ugh} {how about just Sis?}

00:23:34.850 --> 00:23:36.430
Sekai.

00:23:37.270 --> 00:23:38.980
What are you doing?

00:23:38.980 --> 00:23:41.060
The teachers are looking for you.

00:23:41.060 --> 00:23:42.350
Oh! I totally forgot.

00:23:42.350 --> 00:23:46.610
<i>This was how Sekai Kamiki and I first met.</i>

00:23:47.280 --> 00:23:50.200
<i>No, it was how we all met.</i>

00:23:51.990 --> 00:23:56.370
<i>This was the day that team Try Fighters first met.</i>

00:24:00.540 --> 00:24:02.040
The Battle Club's being bullied again?

00:24:02.040 --> 00:24:04.580
I'll deal with them with my Gunpla!

00:24:04.580 --> 00:24:06.880
Next episode, "Team Up, Try Fighters!"

00:24:06.880 --> 00:24:09.670
With my fist, I'll break that wall!
